part of our support members.

261
00:18:27,540 --> 00:18:31,350
But they're only in intermediate school.

262
00:18:31,350 --> 00:18:34,780
Saku might be okay,
but Koyuki's nowhere near our level.

263
00:18:36,220 --> 00:18:40,990
After hearing Saku's drums today,
I wanted to take a gamble on them.

264
00:18:40,990 --> 00:18:47,800
Gamble? With Togo gone,
this whole band could go under.

265
00:18:47,800 --> 00:18:51,730
Technical skill alone
doesn't make a band.

266
00:18:53,030 --> 00:18:56,030
What's important...is the "chemistry."

267
00:19:00,010 --> 00:19:03,410
Ryusuke-kun mentioned "chemistry."

268
00:19:03,410 --> 00:19:07,210
"Chemistry"-like a chemical reaction?

269
00:19:07,210 --> 00:19:09,610
I can just see a huge explosion!

270
00:19:10,750 --> 00:19:12,450
Ka-boom!

271
00:19:17,560 --> 00:19:19,430
You guys haven't heard?

272
00:19:19,430 --> 00:19:23,260
We're performing live a week from now?

273
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:24,730
But we haven't practiced long...

274
00:19:24,730 --> 00:19:27,570
It's an event with some
serious attendance.

275
00:19:27,570 --> 00:19:33,570
We're gonna wow the crowd and
take the other bands' customers!

276
00:19:33,570 --> 00:19:35,140
-Oh...
-Oh...

277
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:38,850
So we're gonna practice extra hard,
starting tomorrow.

278
00:19:38,850 --> 00:19:42,080
Hey, Chiba-kun! Pay up, won't you?

279
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:45,080
Huh? Don't got none.

280
00:20:01,500 --> 00:20:02,990
Check it out!

281
00:20:04,340 --> 00:20:05,500
Yeah!

282
00:20:06,440 --> 00:20:09,270
Hey! You're off beat!

283
00:20:41,010 --> 00:20:43,910
What, you want me to carry this?!

284
00:20:43,910 --> 00:20:46,280
Ouch...

285
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:49,350
Hey, are you all right?

286
00:20:49,350 --> 00:20:52,250
I think I'm just a bit nervous.

287
00:20:52,250 --> 00:20:55,320
Hey, are you getting nervous
about carrying in the equipment?

288
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:59,560
Come on, everyone gets nervous
before playing a gig.

289
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:05,570
Even Jimi Hendrix, Jimmy Page,
Flea, Tom Morello...

290
00:21:05,570 --> 00:21:08,040
Everyone's the same.

291
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:13,440
But, I heard that the Stones
play billiards before playing live...

292
00:21:13,440 --> 00:21:15,870
They do that to ease the tension.

293
00:21:18,180 --> 00:21:21,020
Saku...Wanna go shoot some pool?

294
00:21:21,020 --> 00:21:23,580
Huh? What about the rehearsal?

295
00:21:40,730 --> 00:21:46,370
The bands that were rehearsing
before us were all really good.

296
00:21:47,470 --> 00:21:50,410
Okay, Beck! It's your turn.

297
00:21:53,950 --> 00:21:56,880
During rehearsal,
we check the sound balance.

298
00:21:56,880 --> 00:22:01,380
First we do the drums,
and my vocals get done last.

299
00:22:08,230 --> 00:22:12,260
Oh well, I've got to do my very best now.

300
00:22:26,780 --> 00:22:30,650
The guitar, please. 15 minutes left.

301
00:22:50,340 --> 00:22:52,440
Another minute

302
00:22:52,440 --> 00:22:55,140
Feelin' so fine

303
00:22:57,450 --> 00:22:59,680
You turn the freeze

304
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:02,410
into warm light

305
00:23:04,520 --> 00:23:08,090
Had a premonition

306
00:23:08,090 --> 00:23:10,790
I've been waitin' ever since

307
00:23:10,790 --> 00:23:14,300
My world comin' down

308
00:23:14,300 --> 00:23:17,100
It's got me spinnin' 'round

309
00:23:18,870 --> 00:23:25,040
If you really wanna fly

310
00:23:25,040 --> 00:23:27,810
you gotta let go

311
00:23:40,060 --> 00:23:42,390
Simply the most

312
00:23:42,390 --> 00:23:44,430
big sensation

313
00:23:44,430 --> 00:23:47,230
(once you're here you won't go back)

314
00:23:47,230 --> 00:23:49,500
She's really pretty

315
00:23:49,500 --> 00:23:51,500
One-eyed vision

316
00:23:51,500 --> 00:23:54,340
(lose the fear it don't come back)

317
00:23:54,340 --> 00:23:57,840
Little sister showed me

318
00:23:57,840 --> 00:24:00,510
Really took me for a ride

319
00:24:00,510 --> 00:24:02,180
My world comin' down

320
00:24:02,180 --> 00:24:05,520
(once you're here you won't go back)

321
00:24:05,520 --> 00:24:09,540
(lose the fear it don't come back)

322
00:24:13,860 --> 00:24:16,260
-This is Okute-san of Le Mans Porche!
-We're this week's musicians!

323
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:17,430
"Next Episode"

324
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:17,430
-This is Okute-san of Le Mans Porche!
-We're this week's musicians!

325
00:24:17,430 --> 00:24:20,190
"Next Episode"

326
00:24:17,430 --> 00:24:20,190
Go, Le Mans Porche! Nice to meet you!
